+plan_id: inv-001
+kind: investigation
+title: F1 attempt-3 escalation
+created: 2026-10-18
+dag: null
+parent: build/F1
+---
+# inv-001: F1 attempt-3 escalation
+## Question
+Why does the reviewer FAIL build/F1 at attempt 2 when every gate held, and is the cause in the code or in the tests?
+## Hypothesis
+The sale compares references as written, and no test sells a reference that differs from a sold one only in case.
+Disproved if a test already sells such a pair, or the comparison normalises case.
